# ImageDescription.action
# This action implements an image description action.
# It takes an image as input and returns a string containing the image description.
# Feedback consists of string containing the partially processed description.

# Goal
sensor_msgs/Image image
---
# Result
string answer
---
# Feedback
string feedback
